//  45-degree views of an extrusion look square) in every pose the engine animates (idle, two walk steps, wind-up,
//  strike), under one sun with the shading held to gentle bands so the painting's colours stay its own. Seen head-on it
//  is the painting, from behind its mirror, from the side the same painting with real depth. A species painted side-on
