//
//  Contract: GFX.pixel3d (an art switch, on in every preset; Options -> Graphics & access, "Pixel-3D models"). For an
//  entity whose sprite name has a model here, animDirectionalSprite answers with the model's cell for the entity's
//  side and pose instead of the painted sprite (or the bestiary's hand-built view); a prop's sprite is swapped under
//  its own name. hs, cx and dy come from the bake (the model's real height in world units, where its feet stand), so a
//  creature keeps the size its def's scale gives it. Off, or until an atlas has loaded, the painted art draws exactly
//  as before. Nothing here touches saves, flags or the RNG.
// ============================================================
